ions"},"865":{"id":"/docs/components/sharelink-2","page_id":"/docs/components/sharelink","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/sharelink#usage-and-limitations","content":"Use `item` for the canonical URL or text payload."},"866":{"id":"/docs/components/sharelink-3","page_id":"/docs/components/sharelink","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/sharelink#usage-and-limitations","content":"`subject` and `message` map to the web share title and text fields."},"867":{"id":"/docs/components/sharelink-4","page_id":"/docs/components/sharelink","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/sharelink#usage-and-limitations","content":"Web Share and clipboard fallback depend on browser support, a secure context and a user gesture. HTTP(S) URLs open in a new tab when Web Share is unavailable; non-URL text uses the clipboard when available. Applications should handle share rejection/cancellation."},"868":{"id":"/docs/components/sheet","page_id":"/docs/components/sheet","type":"page","content":"Sheet","breadcrumbs":["Documentation","Components"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/sheet"},"869":{"id":"/docs/components/sheet-0","page_id":"/docs/components/sheet","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/sheet","content":"A modal presentation with a focus trap, background isolation and scroll lock. Set `isPresented` and close it from `onDismiss`."},"870":{"id":"/docs/components/sheet-1","page_id":"/docs/components/sheet","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/sheet#usage-and-limitations","content":"Usage and limitations"},"871":{"id":"/docs/components/sheet-2","page_id":"/docs/components/sheet","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/sheet#usage-and-limitations","content":"Give the sheet a meaningful `title`, `aria-label`, or `aria-labelledby`."},"872":{"id":"/docs/components/sheet-3","page_id":"/docs/components/sheet","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/sheet#usage-and-limitations","content":"Tab stays inside; Escape and backdrop clicks dismiss by default. Closing restores focus to the opener when it still exists."},"873":{"id":"/docs/components/sheet-4","page_id":"/docs/components/sheet","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/sheet#usage-and-limitations","content":"`interactiveDismissDisabled` blocks Escape, backdrop and drag dismissal. `backgroundInteraction=\"none\"` blocks backdrop dismissal only."},"874":{"id":"/docs/components/sheet-5","page_id":"/docs/components/sheet","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/sheet#usage-and-limitations","content":"Below 768px, or on short touch screens under 500px high, page and form sheets fill the width and attach to the bottom, with rounded top corners. Wider presentations center in the viewport: page sheets cap at 600px, form sheets at 420px. `fullScreen` fills the viewport at every size."},"875":{"id":"/docs/components/sheet-6","page_id":"/docs/components/sheet","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/sheet#usage-and-limitations","content":"Content scrolls and adds safe-area padding for notches and home indicators. Set `viewport-fit=cover` in the page's viewport meta tag to expose browser safe-area insets; embedded hosts can override `--safe-area-top`, `--safe-area-right`, `--safe-area-bottom`, and `--safe-area-left` in CSS."},"876":{"id":"/docs/components/sheet-7","page_id":"/docs/components/sheet","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/sheet#usage-and-limitations","content":"With `backgroundStyle=\"automatic\"`, non-full-screen sheets inherit the `UIProvider` glass toggle and intensity, using regular material for legibility. `glass` overrides this surface. Large detents become more opaque; full-screen sheets stay opaque. Explicit `backgroundStyle` values take precedence over glass preferences. Reduced transparency, increased contrast and forced colors restore an opaque surface."},"877":{"id":"/docs/components/sheet-8","page_id":"/docs/components/sheet","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/sheet#usage-and-limitations","content":"Medium and large detents are 50% and 90% of viewport height. Numeric detents use pixels; percentage strings are also accepted. Content scrolls within the panel."},"878":{"id":"/docs/components/sheet-9","page_id":"/docs/components/sheet","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/sheet#usage-and-limitations","content":"Drag the handle to resize and release to snap to the nearest detent. Drag below the smallest detent to dismiss; content remains independently scrollable. Click the handle or activate it with Enter/Space to cycle detents. `defaultSelectedDetent` resets each time an uncontrolled sheet opens."},"879":{"id":"/docs/components/sheet-10","page_id":"/docs/components/sheet","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/sheet#usage-and-limitations","content":"Content is portaled after mounting and is absent from server HTML. Nested modals handle Escape at the top layer."},"880":{"id":"/docs/components/sheet-11","page_id":"/docs/components/sheet","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/sheet#usage-and-limitations","content":"These breakpoints, detent heights and motion curves are Web adaptations; native SwiftUI presentation varies by OS version, device and size class."},"881":{"id":"/docs/components/slider","page_id":"/docs/components/slider","type":"page","content":"Slider","breadcrumbs":["Documentation","Components"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/slider"},"882":{"id":"/docs/components/slider-0","page_id":"/docs/components/slider","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/slider","content":"Select a numeric value with a native range input."},"883":{"id":"/docs/components/slider-1","page_id":"/docs/components/slider","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/slider#uncontrolled-usage","content":"Uncontrolled Usage"},"884":{"id":"/docs/components/slider-2","page_id":"/docs/components/slider","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/slider#usage-and-limitations","content":"Usage and limitat